{"pin":"BH00751","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00751","anchor":"","first_line":"O Trustee! Through the loving-kindness of the Lord of all worlds thou hast attained unto the manifest horizon, and through the effulgences of the lights of the Ancient Beauty in this [3.5s]... ...O my God, my Master, the Beloved and Desire of my heart, Whose remembrance and praise grace my lips and resound in the depths of my soul!","first_line_orig":"ای امین بعنایت رب العالمین بافق مبین فائز شدی و باشراقات انوار جمال قدم در این  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1040","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"tablets","type_name":"Tablets of Bahá'u'lláh","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11096#018","source":"BLIB_Or11096","locator":"018"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15698.247","source":"BLIB_Or15698","locator":"247"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15720.243","source":"BLIB_Or15720","locator":"243"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15740.188","source":"BLIB_Or15740","locator":"188"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM1#008 p.027x","source":"ADM1","locator":"008 p.027x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/557.pdf#page=27"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.099.07x","source":"AVK2","locator":"099.07x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-100.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#610","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"610","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/520794480"},{"kind":"publication","code":"GHA.073bx","source":"GHA","locator":"073bx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/GHA/gha-82.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"IQT.247","source":"IQT","locator":"247","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/IQT/iqt-247.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#019x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"019x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=9"}]},{"code":"BH00751BEL","a